{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（16日）傍晚6時23分，警方接獲一名報案指，發現一名女子於屯門黃金泳灘近岸邊位置昏迷，懷疑遇溺。</p><p>救護人員到場，事主仍然不省人事，立即將其送往屯門醫院治理，其後證實死亡。死者死因有待驗屍後確定。警方現正追查事發原因。</p><figure><img alt=\"女子被送往屯門醫院救治，惜最終證實不治。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260723/1156907447559000064023786.jpeg/nVIlcnDaIqrAgke38emFrSBL53nDAn_8D6MqNA-jKjQ\"/><figcaption>女子被送往屯門醫院救治，惜最終證實不治。</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T14:20:29.998590+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":132,"images":1,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T14:04:14+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T15:37:48.323856+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T14:17:40.056961+00:00","content_hash":"1d7e051111fc418b8e7566a2a9b2e4a7e47c1b78f077d85c19445a3f40360832","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}